WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.394 --> 00:00:03.927
Unit nineteen. City vs Countryside!

2
00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:13.472
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Pre-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.522 --> 00:00:17.575
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:21.717
Today we learn: City vs Countryside. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:26.820
City life. Say it with me. City life!

6
00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:34.696
Countryside. Say it with me. Countryside!

7
00:00:38.203 --> 00:00:42.436
Convenience. Say it with me. Convenience!

8
00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:49.792
Peaceful. Say it with me. Peaceful!

9
00:00:53.301 --> 00:00:57.035
Crowded. Say it with me. Crowded!

10
00:01:00.529 --> 00:01:04.646
Fresh air. Say it with me. Fresh air!

11
00:01:08.149 --> 00:01:12.449
Opportunity. Say it with me. Opportunity!

12
00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.290
Lifestyle. Say it with me. Lifestyle!

13
00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:33.255
Grammar time! Comparatives and contrast. Listen. The countryside is more peaceful than the city.

14
00:01:33.305 --> 00:01:38.902
Your turn. Say it with me. The countryside is more peaceful than the city.

15
00:01:43.763 --> 00:01:57.786
City life offers convenience and opportunity, but it can feel crowded and busy. The countryside is more peaceful, with fresh air, but fewer opportunities. Each lifestyle has its own advantages.

16
00:01:57.836 --> 00:01:59.407
I like this story!

17
00:02:00.348 --> 00:02:05.789
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:05.839 --> 00:02:07.143
Convenience!

19
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:13.519
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:14.821
Opportunity!

21
00:02:15.906 --> 00:02:26.112
Think and answer. Would you rather live in the city or the countryside? Why?

22
00:02:26.162 --> 00:02:27.378
Great answer!

23
00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:31.433
This unit's value is Open-Mindedness.

24
00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:34.708
I can show open-mindedness every day!

25
00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:44.892
Congratulations, everyone! You finished the Pre-Intermediate level. See you in Intermediate. Goodbye!

26
00:02:44.942 --> 00:02:49.400
Thank you, Teacher Chanthy! See you in Intermediate!

